DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       iinnvvookkee--rrcc..dd is a generic interface  to  execute  System  V  style  init
       script  //eettcc//iinniitt..dd//_n_a_m_e  actions, obeying runlevel constraints as well
       as any local policies set by the system administrator.

       All access to the init scripts by Debian packages'  maintainer  scripts
       should be done through iinnvvookkee--rrcc..dd.

       This manpage documents only the usage and behavior of iinnvvookkee--rrcc..dd.  For
       a discussion of the System V style init script arrangements please  see
       iinniitt(8).   More  information on invoke-rc.d can be found in the section
       on runlevels and init.d scripts of the _D_e_b_i_a_n _P_o_l_i_c_y _M_a_n_u_a_l.

